	(uuid "4178b7d0-cf29-4cf2-b214-acbbbd97d338")
	(paper "A4")
	(title_block
		(title "FOBtool Handheld RF Security Platform")
		(rev "A")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "											 Notes\n\n	Power:\n		Keep CHG_CE_N high, BOOST_5V_EN low and USB_HOST_VBUS_EN low during initialization. \n		Set charger input-current limit from the detected USB-C source. \n		Enable +5V_SYS before VBUS_HOST and reverse the sequence during shutdown.\n\n	RP2350/WIRED_IO:\n		Default USB_HOST_VBUS_EN low. \n		Monitor USB_HOST_FAULT_N and immediately disable VBUS_HOST on an asserted fault.\n\n	HMI:\n		TCA9534 address = 0x21. Configure P0-P3 as inputs before enabling P4 as the common active-low LED sink. \n		Configure DRV2605L for LRA operation and calibrate for the C08-005 actuator.\n\n	POSITIONING:\n		MAX-M10N V_BCKP is not powered; expect a cold start after complete power loss. \n		Hold NFC_VEN and NFC_DWL_REQ low during startup. \n		Change LF coil selection only while LF transmission is disabled.\n\n	CAN assembly:\n		Populate split termination Resistors only when this PCB is located at a physical end of the CAN bus.\n\n\n\n\n	"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
